<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Where is Bill - Location Cards</title>
<style>
    body {
        background-color: #f4f6f8;
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 2rem;
        padding: 3rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    /* Card Sizing & Perspective */
    .card-container {
        width: 2.25in;
        height: 3.5in;
        perspective: 1000px; /* Gives the 3D flip effect */
    }

    .card {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        position: relative;
        transition: transform 0.6s;
        transform-style: preserve-3d;
        cursor: pointer;
        /* Subtle shadow for depth */
        box-shadow: 4px 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .card-container:hover .card {
        transform: rotateY(180deg);
    }

    /* Shared styles for Front and Back */
    .card-face {
        position: absolute;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        -webkit-backface-visibility: hidden;
        backface-visibility: hidden;
        border-radius: 8px;
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 2px solid #2b3035;
    }

    /* FRONT: The Google Photo */
    .card-front {
        background-color: #333;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: flex-end;
        /* Placeholder for your actual Google Photo URLs */
        background-image: url('https://via.placeholder.com/300x500/555/fff?text=Photo+of+Union+Station');
        background-size: cover;
        background-position: center;
    }

    .card-front .label {
        background: rgba(43, 48, 53, 0.85);
        color: white;
        padding: 0.5rem;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        border-top: 2px solid #d9534f;
    }

    /* BACK: The Title Block & Mechanics */
    .card-back {
        background-color: white;
        color: #333;
        transform: rotateY(180deg);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        /* 1/16" Graph Paper Background */
        background-image: 
            linear-gradient(#e1e5e9 1px, transparent 1px), 
            linear-gradient(90deg, #e1e5e9 1px, transparent 1px);
        background-size: 10px 10px;
    }

    .title-block {
        border-bottom: 3px double #2b3035;
        padding: 1rem 0.5rem;
        text-align: center;
        background: white;
    }

    .title-block h2 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1.4rem;
        color: #2b3035;
        /* Placeholder for SquareFont */
        font-family: monospace; 
        letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .mechanics {
        padding: 1rem;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        line-height: 1.4;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
        flex-grow: 1;
    }

    .mechanics strong {
        color: #d9534f; /* Drafting Red for the Action trigger */
    }

    .card-index {
        text-align: right;
        padding: 0.5rem;
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #888;
        background: white;
        border-top: 1px solid #ccc;
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Card 1: PDX -->
    <div class="card-container">
        <div class="card">
            <!-- Front: Photo -->
            <div class="card-face card-front" style="background-image: url('https://via.placeholder.com/300x500/2b3035/fff?text=PDX+Union+Station+Photo');">
                <div class="label">PDX</div>
            </div>
            <!-- Back: Mechanics -->
            <div class="card-face card-back">
                <div class="title-block">
                    <h2>PDX</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="mechanics">
                    <em>Rainy Day Crafts.</em> The weather rolls in, so you head out to the Country Pride cafe in Troutdale to grab a table and a coffee.<br><br>
                    <strong>Action:</strong> Refuel your resources. Discard any negative status effects and advance 2 spaces.
                </div>
                <div class="card-index">WIB-07</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 2: MOJAVE -->
    <div class="card-container">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-face card-front" style="background-image: url('https://via.placeholder.com/300x500/d9534f/fff?text=Mojave+Bus+Photo');">
                <div class="label">MOJAVE</div>
            </div>
            <div class="card-face card-back">
                <div class="title-block">
                    <h2>MOJAVE</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="mechanics">
                    <em>The Crossroads.</em> You’ve hit the regional transit interchange.<br><br>
                    <strong>Action:</strong> Transfer your token to the ESTA or Kern Transit line. Immediately jump to either the High Desert or Bishop space.
                </div>
                <div class="card-index">WIB-01</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
